===Pronoun===
{{is-noun|@@:pronoun|pos=pronoun}}{{cln|is|indefinite pronouns}}

# [[one]], [[you]]
#: {{ux|is|'''Maður''' [[gera|gerir]] [[þetta]] [[svona]].|'''You''' do it like this./'''One''' does it like this.}}
#: {{ux|is|'''Manni''' [[líða|líður]] [[eins og]] '''maður''' [[vera|sé]] [[að]] [[taka]] [[crazy]] [[pill|pills]].|'''One''' feels like '''one''''s taking crazy pills.}}

====Usage notes====
* The pronoun ''maður'' declines as the noun, but cannot take the definite article.
* It is placed in a clause in the same way as the noun, but the difference is in the stress: as a pronoun, it never takes the main stress in a sentence.
* It also cannot be substituted with the pronoun {{m|is|hann}} due to being a pronoun itself. Usage of [[þú]] for the [[fourth person]] is {{lg|proscribed}}.

